  "mathematical_geometry": "Gaussian [4 1]_q counts projective points of F_q^4; Gaussian [4 2]_q counts 2-subspaces. A supplied nondegenerate alternating 2-form selects exactly (q+1)(q\u00b2+1) isotropic 2-spaces, defining the lines of W(3,q). At q=3 the count is 40 of 130 total, with 90 excluded. This does not determine q=3 uniquely.",
